-- (m)
#ASSERT `s 2020(m) the Secretary must provide for the use of fee agents in the area` `Alaska, rural 1` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2020(m) the Secretary must provide for the use of fee agents in the area` `Alaska, rural 2` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2020(m) the Secretary must provide for the use of fee agents in the area` `Alaska, urban` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 2020(m) the Secretary must provide for the use of fee agents in the area` Hawaii EQUALS NOTHING
`a paid agent authorized by the State` MEANS `s 2020(m) facts about a person who may be a fee agent` WITH `the person is a paid agent` IS TRUE, `the person is a State employee` IS FALSE, `the person is authorized by the State to make applications available to low-income households, assist in the completion of applications, conduct required interviews, secure required verification, forward completed applications and supporting documentation to the State agency, and provide other services as required by the State agency` IS TRUE
`a State employee` MEANS `s 2020(m) facts about a person who may be a fee agent` WITH `the person is a paid agent` IS TRUE, `the person is a State employee` IS TRUE, `the person is authorized by the State to make applications available to low-income households, assist in the completion of applications, conduct required interviews, secure required verification, forward completed applications and supporting documentation to the State agency, and provide other services as required by the State agency` IS TRUE
`an unpaid volunteer` MEANS `s 2020(m) facts about a person who may be a fee agent` WITH `the person is a paid agent` IS FALSE, `the person is a State employee` IS FALSE, `the person is authorized by the State to make applications available to low-income households, assist in the completion of applications, conduct required interviews, secure required verification, forward completed applications and supporting documentation to the State agency, and provide other services as required by the State agency` IS TRUE
`a paid agent not authorized` MEANS `s 2020(m) facts about a person who may be a fee agent` WITH `the person is a paid agent` IS TRUE, `the person is a State employee` IS FALSE, `the person is authorized by the State to make applications available to low-income households, assist in the completion of applications, conduct required interviews, secure required verification, forward completed applications and supporting documentation to the State agency, and provide other services as required by the State agency` IS FALSE
